{"id": "tatoeba:14098009", "text": "No one is cringe; people cringe at others, which is their own problem.", "lang": "en", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "rul", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098009", "tier": "short"}
{"id": "tatoeba:14098032", "text": "You can do it. I believe in you, my daughter.", "lang": "en", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Ioan_Cristian", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098032", "tier": "short"}
{"id": "tatoeba:14098037", "text": "I cried for you. Now cry for me.", "lang": "en", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "carlosalberto", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098037", "tier": "short"}
{"id": "tatoeba:14098039", "text": "Sometimes, one has to listen to their heart.", "lang": "en", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Ioan_Cristian", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098039", "tier": "short"}
{"id": "tatoeba:14098043", "text": "He's stolen my toys yet again!", "lang": "en", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Ioan_Cristian", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098043", "tier": "short"}
{"id": "tatoeba:14098047", "text": "I'll be there, I promise.", "lang": "en", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Ioan_Cristian", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098047", "tier": "short"}
{"id": "tatoeba:14098051", "text": "He doesn't travel to Germany anymore? He has changed his mind?", "lang": "en", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Ioan_Cristian", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098051", "tier": "short"}
{"id": "tatoeba:14098055", "text": "Her friends are trying to console her.", "lang": "en", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Ioan_Cristian", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098055", "tier": "short"}
{"id": "tatoeba:14098061", "text": "Can you talk with me briefly?", "lang": "en", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Ioan_Cristian", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098061", "tier": "short"}
{"id": "tatoeba:14098066", "text": "Maria and Hans want to break up. They no longer get with each other.", "lang": "en", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Ioan_Cristian", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098066", "tier": "short"}
{"id": "tatoeba:14098070", "text": "A baby without his parents is helpless.", "lang": "en", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Ioan_Cristian", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098070", "tier": "short"}
{"id": "tatoeba:14098076", "text": "After the appointment with the therapist, she now feels relieved.", "lang": "en", "source": "tatoeba", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Ioan_Cristian", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/14098076", "tier": "short"}
